{"id": "t104-002", "text": "Call with Michael. His brother Sam is running the Manchester half on Sunday morning, first one ever, and he's been training since March. Remind me to text Sam good luck the night before", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Manchester half", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since March"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Sam good luck", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t104-008", "text": "emeka mentioned his son Chidi got into the county under 14s squad. trials were brutal apparently. he's buzzing", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "emeka", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chidi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the county under 14s squad", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trials", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "buzzing", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t104-009", "text": "Coffee with Caitlin. She's been really struggling since the breakup with Liam, not sleeping much and she's lost weight. Her sister Niamh is coming to stay for a bit next week which should help, and her mum keeps ringing every night which she finds a lot. Work have been decent about it. I should check in with her Sunday evening and maybe suggest the cinema", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "breakup", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Liam", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not sleeping much", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "lost weight", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Niamh", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming to stay", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a bit", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every night"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "finds a lot", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday evening", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "suggest the cinema", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t104-010", "text": "Karan's band have a gig at the Brudenell on the 3rd at 9. He's on bass. Said Divya might come too", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gig at the Brudenell", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd at 9", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bass", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t104-013", "text": "Fatima's kids both have their swimming gala on Saturday, starts at 9am, and then her eldest has a piano exam the Monday after. Busy week for her. Remind me to ask how the exam went that evening", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fatima", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "swimming gala", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "9am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "piano exam", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Monday after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how the exam went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t104-014", "text": "Aurelio is obsessed with padel at the moment, plays three times a week", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aurelio", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "padel", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three times a week"}]}
{"id": "t104-015", "text": "voice note. Abdi rang. his dad passed away on Tuesday night, it was quite sudden, a stroke. funeral is Friday the 18th at 11 at the mosque on Green Lane and then back to the family house afterwards. he sounded exhausted, he's been sorting everything because his older brother is stuck in Nairobi. I need to send flowers to his mum before then and call him the day after the funeral", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abdi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday the 18th at 11", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send flowers to his mum", "owner": "r3", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before then", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after the funeral", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t104-019", "text": "Henrik is vegan now, and allergic to sesame. Keep in mind for the dinner", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Henrik", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegan", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergic to sesame", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t104-020", "text": "Tomás (Tommy) is doing the Ironman in Tenby in September. He's mad. Training every morning at 5", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomás", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tommy", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Ironman in Tenby", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every morning at 5"}]}
{"id": "t104-021", "text": "Saw Pedro at the school gates. His wife Ana is due any day now, they've had two false alarms already, and their eldest Sofia starts reception in September so they're also doing school visits. He's running on fumes. He mentioned his parents are coming over from Porto the week after the baby arrives to help out, which he seemed a bit mixed about", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ana", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "any day now", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "reception", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "running on fumes", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming over from Porto", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after the baby arrives", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit mixed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t104-023", "text": "Luis said his nephew is in the regional chess championship this weekend and he's driving him up to Leeds Saturday morning", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luis", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nephew", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "regional chess championship", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday morning", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t104-027", "text": "kasia's partner Ola has a big presentation to the board tomorrow morning at 9, she was helping him rehearse all weekend. he's not slept", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ola", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "big presentation to the board", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow morning at 9", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "all weekend"}]}
{"id": "t104-028", "text": "Long chat with Niamh on the phone. Her mum had a fall last month and has broken her wrist, so Niamh's been going over every evening after work. Her brother Declan is meant to be helping but he's in Dublin and never answers. She's knackered and a bit fed up with him, understandably. On top of that her own half marathon is on the 9th and she's barely trained. Need to call her the weekend before and maybe offer to do a shop for her mum", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Niamh", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "broken her wrist", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Niamh", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening after work"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Declan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Dublin", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "knackered", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit fed up", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "half marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 9th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to do a shop for her mum", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t104-030", "text": "Dalia mentioned her son Omar and his girlfriend are expecting! Due in January. Dalia's going to be a granny, she can't stop smiling", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't stop smiling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t104-034", "text": "Divya's brother Arjun is getting married in Jaipur in Feb. She's flying out on the 2nd and staying two weeks, the mehndi is on the 6th and the wedding itself the day after. Her mum's stressing about the seating plan already and Arjun apparently couldn't care less. Divya's doing a dance with her cousins and is terrified. Ask her for pics when she's back", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arjun", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married in Jaipur", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in Feb", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "two weeks", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "mehndi", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 6th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressing about the seating plan", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arjun", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "couldn't care less", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dance", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask her for pics", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "when she's back", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t104-037", "text": "Sam Hughes from work - wife's having surgery on her knee on Monday. He's taking the week off. I should cover his Weds meeting", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam Hughes", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from work", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking the week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "cover his Weds meeting", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Weds", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t104-044", "text": "Aurelio's son Matteo plays for the under 12s, they've got the cup final on Saturday at 10 at Hackney Marshes. Aurelio is more nervous than Matteo, honestly. His wife Giulia is working so can't make it, and the car's in the garage, so he asked if I could give them a lift there, said yes. Need to leave by 9. Matteo wants to be a keeper like his dad was", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aurelio", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matteo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "plays for the under 12s", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cup final", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday at 10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aurelio", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matteo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p5", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "leave", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by 9", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matteo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to be a keeper", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t104-047", "text": "Carmen's mum is staying with them for a month from the 1st. Carmen sounded a bit frazzled about it", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carmen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying with them", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "from the 1st", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carmen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit frazzled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t104-050", "text": "Henrik Andersson - new neighbour at no. 14. Swedish, works at the hospital as a radiographer. Two kids, Freja and Oskar, and a massive dog called Bamse", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Henrik Andersson", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "neighbour at no. 14", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Swedish", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "works at the hospital as a radiographer", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "Two kids", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Freja", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oskar", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "massive dog called Bamse", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t104-051", "text": "tomas said his sister Lucia is singing at the jazz festival on the 17th, 4pm slot on the main stage, biggest gig she's ever done. his parents are flying over from Madrid for it and staying the week after, so he's repainting the spare room this weekend in a panic. she's been doing vocal lessons twice a week. remind me to ask tommy for the stream link", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "tomas", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lucia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "singing at the jazz festival", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 17th, 4pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying over from Madrid", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "repainting the spare room", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in a panic", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "twice a week"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask tommy for the stream link", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "tommy", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t104-052", "text": "Pedro's wife had the baby! Little boy, Rafael, born Tuesday morning. Both doing well. I must send a card and maybe a hamper the week after when they've settled", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Little boy", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rafael", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing well", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send a card and maybe a hamper", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after when they've settled", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t104-053", "text": "Joseph is playing in the club tennis tournament this weekend, semis Saturday afternoon and final Sunday if he gets through. Hasn't lost a set all season", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joseph", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "club tennis tournament", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "semis", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday afternoon", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "final", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "all season"}]}
{"id": "t104-054", "text": "Called Luis back. His mum's results came back clear, huge relief. He's taking her away to Cornwall for a few days at the end of the month", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luis", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "relief", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking her away to Cornwall", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few days", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t104-055", "text": "Mariam and Aiko were both at Kasia's thing last night. Mariam's starting a new job at the BBC on Monday, producer on the radio side, which she's been after for ages. Aiko's off to Japan for three weeks on the 20th to see her gran, who isn't well. Kasia was quiet all night and left early, I think something's up with her. Should message her later in the week", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mariam", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aiko", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mariam", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at the BBC", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "producer on the radio side", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aiko", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Japan", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "three weeks", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 20th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "gran", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't well", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "all night"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p3", "action_type": "message", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "later in the week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t104-056", "text": "Mehmet said his brother's restaurant opens on Saturday. Launch party Friday night 7pm, invite only, he got me on the list", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "restaurant opens", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Launch party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday night 7pm", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t104-058", "text": "Note from the hairdresser chat: Naledi's mum is a retired music teacher, still plays organ at their church every Sunday morning", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Naledi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "retired music teacher", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "organ", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "every Sunday morning"}]}
